<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wild Oats cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wild Oats cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Adams Harkness said it cut its rating on Wild Oats Markets Inc to market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- Cited increasing competitive pressure from Whole Foods Markets Inc.</p>
<p>-- Wild Oats also said Tuesday S.M. &quot;Hass&quot; Hassan resigned as company president, effective Feb 4. Jim Lee, Wild Oats current chief operating officer, will fill the position permanently, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Wild Oats lost 4-3/4 to 13 in afternoon trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
